        "built. Every action targets one tab id (the active tab is reported "
        "when omitted) and returns what the page actually contains — never a "
        "guess. There is NO research browser button anywhere — when the user "
        "says 'open the research browser', 'show me the browser' or 'open the "
        "live browser', call this tool with action='open'. Actions: "
        "navigate_to_url | new_tab | list_tabs | go_back | "
