        "Kanpur', 'show New Delhi', 'zoom into the Eiffel Tower', 'zoom out to "
        "the whole Earth', 'reset the globe', 'turn on the satellite layer', "
        "'close the globe'). Locations are resolved by the globe's own search, "
        "so pass the FULL place text the user said (city, state, country) — "
        "never a guess at coordinates. Exact coordinates the user states are "
        "passed as latitude/longitude and are used as given. Route ordinary "
        "questions ABOUT globes, libraries or 3D mapping to web research "
        "instead — do not open the globe for those. Report exactly what the "
